  "ruleText": "Cor 101.06 “Commissioner” means the individual in charge of the operations of the department of corrections, who is directly responsible to the governor.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (formerly Cor 101.05) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
